  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://pnb.bank.in/Recruitments.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Punjab National Bank (PNB)</a> </span>has released the Admit Card for the post of Local Bank Officer (LBO). This recruitment has been issued for 545 posts. The online application process for Punjab National Bank PNB LBO Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 20 July 2026, to 16 August 2026 (Extended). The Examination is going to conducted on 06 September 2026. Candidates must download their Punjab National Bank PNB LBO Recruitment 2026, which are given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Punjab National Bank (PNB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Punjab National Bank PNB LBO Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>20 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>16 August 2026 (Exdtended)</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>16 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : <strong>06 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>28 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC :<strong> Rs. 1180/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 59/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>PNB Bank LBO Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>20 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per PNB Bank LBO Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #0000ff; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>PNB Bank LBO 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 545 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; widt